 جرانتريل/جرانتيل, امبوفير/اميفير, ديباكين/ديبيكان, or dropped initial 'ا', dropped single letters or missing dots like 'ن' or 'ب', Persian/Urdu letters like پ for ب or \n<truncated 3498 bytes>\nnit vs wholesale carton/bundle (e.g. 20 tablets vs باكت 32, باكت 200, 32ب) -> THIS IS A 100% MATCH (\"status\": \"match\")!\r\n54:      - Strips vs total tablets (e.g. 3 strips vs 12 tablets) -> THIS IS A 100% MATCH (\"status\": \"match\")!\r\n55:      - Missing pack count on either side -> THIS IS A 100% MATCH (\"status\": \"match\")!\r\n56:      - Manufacturer suffixes (/فاركو, /جلاكسو), commercial indicators (\"س ج\", \"سعر جديد\", \"سعر قديم\") do not change the product.\r\n57:      - NEVER mark tablet count, pack count, or wholesale carton differences as \"review\" or \"no_match\"!\r\n58:    - \"review\" IS STRICTLY RESERVED FOR:\r\n59:      - Conflicting bottle/tube volume of liquids/semi-solids when BOTH sides explicitly specify different numbers (e.g. requested 15ml drops vs candidate writes 5ml drops).\r\n60:      - Conflicting injection pack count when explicitly different (e.g. requested 3 ampoules vs candidate writes 1 ampoule).\r\n61: \r\n62: SCHEMA:\r\n63: Return ONLY a valid JSON object matching this schema:\r\n64: {\r\n65:   \"results\": [\r\n66:     {\r\n67:       \"case_id\": \"string\",\r\n68:       \"status\": \"match\" | \"review\",\r\n69:       \"item_id\": \"string (the matching candidate ID)\",\r\n70:       \"reason\": \"string (Arabic explanation when review, otherwise empty string)\"\r\n71:     }\r\n72:   ]\r\n73: }\r\n74: \r\n75: CRITICAL RULES FOR RESPONSE:\r\n76: - ONLY include cases that are \"match\" or \"review\".\r\n77: - DO NOT return cases that are \"no_match\" (any omitted case_id is automatically considered no_match).\r\n78: - DO NOT return markdown blocks (no ```json). Return ONLY the raw JSON starting with { and ending with }.\r\n79: \"\"\"\r\n80: \r\n81: class FastCoordinator:\r\n82:     def __init__(self, config: Config):\r\n83:      